{
  "_about": "The LumeBook icon set (5 Nov 2026, from HQ's tool cubes). Line icons on a 24 grid: each value is the inner markup of <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"> drawn with fill none, stroke currentColor, stroke width 2, round caps and joins. Names are stable ids (saved HQ layouts store them): add icons, never rename or remove one. Two groups: icons (pictures for tools and topics; HQ's icon picker offers these) and ui (interface glyphs: drag grip, plus, pencil, open elsewhere, back, and the creator map's buttons, arrows and rating marks). design.py: icons(), ui_icons(), icon(name). tools/lumebook.py sync writes icons.js (window.LB_ICONS) and copies it to pages without a build (the dashboard).",
